==Trivia==
This is the only diamond-rarity card in the {{TCGP|Paldean Wonders}} expansion to feature original artwork not previously used in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]].

===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration features {{p|Pawmo}} and {{p|Pikachu}}.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Pawmo}}.
*'''Head Bolt''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Arceus|Manectric|44}} from the {{TCG|Platinum: Arceus|Arceus}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

